<title>UK: SBC Jersey sets 150 mln rand one-year bond. [CORRECTED 12:00 GMT]</title>
<headline>SBC Jersey sets 150 mln rand one-year bond. [CORRECTED 12:00 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager SBC Warburg.</p>
<p>(Corrects currency in table below from SFR TO ZAR).</p>
<p> BORROWER   SBC JERSEY BRANCH</p>
<p> AMT    150 MLN ZAR   COUPON     15.625    MATURITY    13.MAY.98</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.83    PAY DATE    13.MAY.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.00	REOFFER    99.955    SPREAD	=</p>
<p> MOODY	AA1	 LISTING    LONDON    PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AA+	 DENOMS (K) 5-50	SALE LIMITS US/UK/ZA</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.125     SELL CONC  0.875     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
